      "text": "### Book stock in ERP\n\n**Return** {{returnId}} · **order** {{orderId}} · **customer** {{customerEmail}}\n\n1. Open the [ERP booking page]({{erpUrl}}) (data is prefilled).\n2. Check the items, enter warehouse, date and clerk, press **Buchen**.\n3. Copy the document number into the field below.",
